[00:00.00]No need to stay
[00:02.42]No need to hold
[00:05.34]What is here, is not moving
[00:08.40]I don’t keep it, I don’t lose it
[00:11.54]It stays without me
[00:14.18]Breath comes and rests
[00:16.86]Time passes softly
[00:20.70]Nothing pulls, nothing calls
[00:25.94]No balance to manage
[00:28.70]No space to open
[00:31.68]No fullness to defend
[00:34.16]Just being
[00:35.14]I don’t remain, I don’t arrive
[00:37.34]I don’t follow, I don’t wait
[00:39.06]What is, is enough
[00:42.02]Without saying so
[00:44.88]The ground is quiet
[00:47.58]The air is wide
[00:49.04]I don’t stand, I don’t rest
[00:51.92]I simply am
[00:54.20]Just being
